78473	 [
See Memo DMG SPC 53
] Charges for certain services not connected with the provision of adequate accommodation are not eligible. When considering if services are connected to the adequacy of the accommodation (see DMG 78457 3.) the DM should take a common sense view of charges for communal lounges, paths, walkways, gardens etc and not just the individual needs of the claimant.

